+<body>
+<!--
+  Child order matters: the main frame's FIRST child is a cross-origin RemoteFrame
+  (iframeRemote), followed by a same-origin LocalFrame (iframeLocal). iframeLocal
+  builds several cross-document back/forward entries; a joint back traversal rooted
+  at the main frame must still re-navigate iframeLocal even though the RemoteFrame
+  sibling precedes it in tree order.
