+  // Give iframeLocal at least one back entry. These location.href navigations are cross-document but
+  // lack transient activation, so past the first push the rest replace; we don't hardcode the resulting
+  // count and only require one back entry (asserted below), which is enough to exercise the joint back
+  // traversal past the RemoteFrame sibling.
+  await navigateLocal(iframeLocal, LOCAL + "?p=1");
+  await navigateLocal(iframeLocal, LOCAL + "?p=2");
+  await navigateLocal(iframeLocal, LOCAL + "?p=3");
